# Publication allowlist: new runtime folders cannot be staged accidentally.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/VERSION
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-build.txt
!/requirements-lock.txt
!/Setup.cmd
!/Start.cmd
!/Demo.cmd
!/Build.cmd
!/Check.cmd
!/Publish.cmd
!/build.py
!/tests*.py
!/src/
!/src/**
!/tools/
!/tools/**
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# Private outputs, including data copied into an allowed directory.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/Logs/
**/DemoLogs/
**/ImportedLogs/
**/RecoveredLogs/
**/Diagnostics/
**/SelectedLaps/
**/data/
**/_backup/
**/_verification/
**/_local/
**/.venv/
**/local_settings.json
**/settings.json
**/reference_settings.json
**/vehicle_settings.json
**/endurance_settings.json
**/last_native_import.json
*.csv
*.lap.json
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.db
*.sqlite*
*.log
*.gz
*.zip
*.exe
*.dll
*.pyd
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.svg
**/FastestLapCompare.html
**/DemoFastestLapCompare.html
**/review.html
**/fastest_lap.html
**/src/tracks/sources/
